      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2836,
        "endIndex": 3092,
        "text": "### **Candidate [5]: Meta Debuts \"Muse\" Personal AI Agent**\n* **What is confirmed:** Meta launched \"Muse\" on September 8, 2026, a proactive personal AI agent designed to automate everyday tasks (booking travel, executing online errands, managing schedules)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3094,
        "endIndex": 3214,
        "text": "It operates via dedicated cloud virtual machines (\"Muse Secure VM\") and is accessible via web, mobile apps, and WhatsApp"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        16,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3216,
        "endIndex": 3304,
        "text": "It offers a free tier as well as paid subscription tiers ($20/mo Power, $100/mo Maximum)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
