        "startIndex": 3570,
        "endIndex": 3808,
        "text": "### **Candidate [6]: Clay Raises $115M at $7.1B Valuation**\n* **What is confirmed:** AI sales and marketing platform Clay raised $115 million led by Wellington Management at a valuation of $7.1 billion, up from $3.1 billion in August 2025"
