        "text": "### **Candidate [8]: OpenAI Deepens Semiconductor Partnership with Samsung**\n* **What is confirmed:** Harrison Kim, GM of OpenAI Korea, stated in Seoul on September 9, 2026, that OpenAI is deepening its partnership with Samsung Electronics to include joint R&D and production of next-generation custom AI chips"
