        "text": "### **Candidate [9]: Terence Tao Warns AI is \"Mining Open Math Problems as Non-Renewable Resource\"**\n* **What is confirmed:** Fields Medal winner Terence Tao published a commentary on Mathstodon on September 8, 2026, cautioning that aggressive AI problem-solving threatens to \"mine\" good open math problems non-renewably, flattening fruitful research avenues before humans can fully develop deep conceptual understanding or maintain open sharing"
